OL,3,APrince Harry and six others ordered to
OL,4,Apay initial #9.5m to Daily Mail
OL,5,Apublisher
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince Harry and six other public
OL,8,Ffigures face paying up to #34.5m to the
OL,9,Fpublisher of the Daily Mail after a
OL,10,FHigh Court judge imposed an exceptional
OL,11,Forder for legal costs over their failed
OL,12,Fprivacy case.
OL,14,FThe seven claimants, also including Sir
OL,15,FElton John and Liz Hurley, must pay an
OL,16,Finitial #9.54m by 28 August to
OL,17,FAssociated Newspapers Limited (ANL).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
