OL,3,APrince Harry and six others ordered to
OL,4,Apay initial #9.5m to Daily Mail
OL,5,Apublisher
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge ruled that the case was a
OL,8,Frare one in which the claimants should
OL,9,Fhave to pay far in excess of the costs
OL,10,Fthat had been agreed before trial,
OL,11,Fcriticising how they presented their
OL,12,Fclaims as "unreasonable to a high
OL,13,Fdegree".
OL,15,FOn 7 July, Judge Mr Justice Nicklin
OL,16,Fdismissed the claims of unlawful
OL,17,Finformation-gathering, which ANL
OL,18,Fdenied.
